  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">naked wings arrive uncoated yet full of flavor, marinated in tangy yogurt with garlic and smoky paprika. As they roast to golden perfection, the kitchen fills with irresistible aroma that pulls everyone closer. A light cornstarch dusting locks in juicy tenderness, and a pinch of cayenne adds playful heat. Serve naked wings hot from the tray with creamy ranch or a zesty lemon herb dip and watch the smiles spread. Perfect for game night or family dinner, these crispy, juicy wings prove that simple ingredients plus a little imagination make an unforgettable feast.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-naked-wings\">Why You’ll Love This naked wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-naked-wings\">How to Make Naked Wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-naked-wings\">Pro Tips for Making naked wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-naked-wings\">How to Serve this naked wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-naked-wings\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This naked wings</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly crispy on the outside, juicy on the inside.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple ingredients make it easy to whip up anytime.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for any sauce or seasoning you love.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for game day or a cozy night in.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthier option without heavy breading.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7497\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7497\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-templat